  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_8f63df35-a9d1-4acf-bb60-fa9ed332fe49.png\"></p><p><strong>物品回收机</strong> 对 ZombieCraft 枪械包的兼容支持。（允许你回收制作材料）</p><p>（提供 30-50% 的材料回收率）<br><br><strong>如果未同时安装任何可选依赖模组，本模组将不会生效！</strong></p><h2><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_15c85f09-3074-48f0-9d3e-a4abc25c6e7d.png\"></h2><p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>必需：</strong></span></p><p><strong>-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/item-scrapper\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">物品回收机</a></strong> 作者：keerdm<br><br><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">可选依赖：</span><br><br>-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/customization/tacz-the-division-gunpack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">全境封锁枪械包</a><br>-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/timeless-and-classics-guns-lesraisins-append-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lesraisins 附加包</a><br>-<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/maxstuff\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Maxstuff</a><br></strong></p>",
